{
  "widgets": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 24,
      "height": 2,
      "properties": {
        "markdown": "# TeraTrip — Laboratorio 3\n**Parte A:** S3 → EventBridge → Step Functions → Textract → normalización → Glue merge → Athena  ·  **Parte B:** Harness → Gateway → (Knowledge Base | Lambda Athena) → Athena\n\nEl pulso del pipeline es *Ejecuciones de la Step Function*. Cuando algo falla, el widget de **Errores** de abajo agrega los logs de las cuatro funciones en un solo lugar."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "alarm",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2,
      "width": 24,
      "height": 3,
      "properties": {
        "title": "Estado del laboratorio",
        "alarms": [
          "arn:aws:cloudwatch:us-east-1:955030484229:alarm:alarm-teratrip-sfn-failed",
          "arn:aws:cloudwatch:us-east-1:955030484229:alarm:alarm-teratrip-lambda-errors"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "metric",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 5,
      "width": 12,
      "height": 6,
      "properties": {
        "title": "Ingesta — Ejecuciones de la Step Function",
        "region": "us-east-1",
        "view": "timeSeries",
        "stacked": false,
        "stat": "Sum",
        "period": 300,
        "metrics": [
          [
            "AWS/States",
            "ExecutionsStarted",
            "StateMachineArn",
            "arn:aws:states:us-east-1:955030484229:stateMachine:sfn-teratrip-ingest",
            {
              "label": "Iniciadas"
            }
          ],
          [
            "AWS/States",
            "ExecutionsSucceeded",
            "StateMachineArn",
            "arn:aws:states:us-east-1:955030484229:stateMachine:sfn-teratrip-ingest",
            {
              "label": "Exitosas",
              "color": "#2ca02c"
            }
          ],
          [
            "AWS/States",
            "ExecutionsFailed",
            "StateMachineArn",
            "arn:aws:states:us-east-1:955030484229:stateMachine:sfn-teratrip-ingest",
            {
              "label": "Fallidas",
              "color": "#d62728"
            }
          ],
          [
            "AWS/States",
            "ExecutionsTimedOut",
            "StateMachineArn",
            "arn:aws:states:us-east-1:955030484229:stateMachine:sfn-teratrip-ingest",
            {
              "label": "Timeout",
              "color": "#ff7f0e"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "yAxis": {
          "left": {
            "min": 0
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "metric",
      "x": 12,
      "y": 5,
      "width": 12,
      "height": 6,
      "properties": {
        "title": "Ingesta — Duración de la ejecución completa",
        "region": "us-east-1",
        "view": "timeSeries",
        "period": 300,
        "metrics": [
          [
            "AWS/States",
            "ExecutionTime",
            "StateMachineArn",
            "arn:aws:states:us-east-1:955030484229:stateMachine:sfn-teratrip-ingest",
